IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `or336-nouns`
IMPORT `or336-art336b`

-- Tests for Art. 336b OR (layer 1, or336-art336b.l4).
--
-- Expected values were written from the German text before the file was run;
-- the dates were counted by hand on the calendar and checked with an
-- independent calendar program, never taken from the encoding. Each period
-- is tested on the day before, the day of and the day after its last day.
--
-- The period of Art. 336b(1) ends with the notice period: here 31 March 2027.
-- The period of Art. 336b(2) is 180 days after the end of the employment:
-- the employment ends 31 December 2026, so the 180 days end 29 June 2027
-- (Jan 31 + Feb 28 + Mar 31 + Apr 30 + May 31 = 151, + 29 days of June = 180).

§ `Tests for Art 336b`

§§ `Fixtures`

-- An objection: the claim rests on Art. 336 and 336a | in writing | against the notice | to the party that gave it | the day made | the last day of the notice period
`objection: all requirements, the day before the last day` MEANS `Objection` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, Date 30 3 2027, Date 31 3 2027
`objection: all requirements, on the last day` MEANS `Objection` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, Date 31 3 2027, Date 31 3 2027
`objection: all requirements, the day after the last day` MEANS `Objection` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, Date 1 4 2027, Date 31 3 2027
`objection: not in writing` MEANS `Objection` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, Date 30 3 2027, Date 31 3 2027
`objection: not against the notice` MEANS `Objection` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, Date 30 3 2027, Date 31 3 2027
`objection: not made to the party that gave the notice` MEANS `Objection` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, Date 30 3 2027, Date 31 3 2027
`objection: claim not under Art 336 and 336a` MEANS `Objection` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, Date 30 3 2027, Date 31 3 2027
`objection: nothing right but in time` MEANS `Objection` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, Date 30 3 2027, Date 31 3 2027

-- An action: the day the employment ended | an action has been brought | the day it was brought | the day asked about
`action: brought the day before the last day` MEANS `Action on the claim` OF Date 31 12 2026, TRUE, Date 28 6 2027, Date 1 7 2027
`action: brought on the last day` MEANS `Action on the claim` OF Date 31 12 2026, TRUE, Date 29 6 2027, Date 1 7 2027
`action: brought the day after the last day` MEANS `Action on the claim` OF Date 31 12 2026, TRUE, Date 30 6 2027, Date 28 6 2027
`action: brought before the employment ended` MEANS `Action on the claim` OF Date 31 12 2026, TRUE, Date 15 12 2026, Date 1 7 2027
`action: none, asked the day before the last day` MEANS `Action on the claim` OF Date 31 12 2026, FALSE, Date 1 1 2000, Date 28 6 2027
`action: none, asked on the last day` MEANS `Action on the claim` OF Date 31 12 2026, FALSE, Date 1 1 2000, Date 29 6 2027
`action: none, asked the day after the last day` MEANS `Action on the claim` OF Date 31 12 2026, FALSE, Date 1 1 2000, Date 30 6 2027

§§ `Art 336b(1): the last day to object`

-- "längstens bis zum Ende der Kündigungsfrist": the last day to object is the end of the notice period.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(1) the last day to object` (Date 31 3 2027) EQUALS Date 31 3 2027
#ASSERT `Art 336b(1) the last day to object` (Date 28 2 2028) EQUALS Date 28 2 2028

§§ `Art 336b(1): the objection meets the requirements`

-- in writing, against the notice, to the party that gave it, and by the end of the notice period: met, on the day before the end, on it.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(1) the objection meets the requirements` `objection: all requirements, the day before the last day` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 336b(1) the objection meets the requirements` `objection: all requirements, on the last day` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after the end of the notice period: "längstens bis zum Ende der Kündigungsfrist" is not met.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(1) the objection meets the requirements` `objection: all requirements, the day after the last day` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- "schriftlich": not in writing.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(1) the objection meets the requirements` `objection: not in writing` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- "gegen die Kündigung": not against the notice.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(1) the objection meets the requirements` `objection: not against the notice` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- "beim Kündigenden": not made to the party that gave the notice.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(1) the objection meets the requirements` `objection: not made to the party that gave the notice` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 336b(1) the objection meets the requirements` `objection: nothing right but in time` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- "Wer gestützt auf Artikel 336 und 336a eine Entschädigung geltend machen will": a claim on another basis is outside the provision.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(1) the objection meets the requirements` `objection: claim not under Art 336 and 336a` EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Art 336b(2): the party that received the notice can assert the claim`

-- "Ist die Einsprache gültig erfolgt und einigen sich die Parteien nicht über die Fortsetzung des Arbeitsverhältnisses, so kann die Partei, der gekündigt worden ist, ihren Anspruch auf Entschädigung geltend machen": valid objection, no agreement.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the party that received the notice can assert the compensation claim` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the parties agreed on continuing: the "wenn"-gate of a power is not met: the text does not say no.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the party that received the notice can assert the compensation claim` (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- no valid objection: Art. 336b(1) says "muss ... Einsprache erheben": no, with or without an agreement.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the party that received the notice can assert the compensation claim` (JUST FALSE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the party that received the notice can assert the compensation claim` (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the objection requirement does not decide on these facts (a claim on another basis): nothing to say either way.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the party that received the notice can assert the compensation claim` NOTHING FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the party that received the notice can assert the compensation claim` NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Art 336b(2): the last day to bring the action`

-- 31 December 2026 + 180 days = 29 June 2027 (Jan 31, Feb 28, Mar 31, Apr 30, May 31 make 151; 29 more days in June).
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the last day to bring the action` (Date 31 12 2026) EQUALS Date 29 6 2027
-- 31 March 2027 + 180 days = 27 September 2027 (Apr 30, May 31, Jun 30, Jul 31, Aug 31 make 153; 27 more in September).
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the last day to bring the action` (Date 31 3 2027) EQUALS Date 27 9 2027
-- 30 June 2027 + 180 days = 27 December 2027.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the last day to bring the action` (Date 30 6 2027) EQUALS Date 27 12 2027
-- the days are calendar days ("Tage"): across 29 February 2028 the same end date gives one day earlier: 31 December 2027 + 180 = 28 June 2028.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the last day to bring the action` (Date 31 12 2027) EQUALS Date 28 6 2028
-- and 29 February 2028 + 180 days = 27 August 2028.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the last day to bring the action` (Date 29 2 2028) EQUALS Date 27 8 2028

§§ `Art 336b(2): the claim is forfeited`

-- "Wird nicht innert 180 Tagen nach Beendigung des Arbeitsverhältnisses eine Klage anhängig gemacht, ist der Anspruch verwirkt." Last day: 29 June 2027.
-- brought the day before the last day, and on it: not forfeited.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the claim is forfeited` `action: brought the day before the last day` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the claim is forfeited` `action: brought on the last day` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- brought the day after the last day: forfeited.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the claim is forfeited` `action: brought the day after the last day` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no action: not yet forfeited on the day before the last day and on it; forfeited the day after.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the claim is forfeited` `action: none, asked the day before the last day` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the claim is forfeited` `action: none, asked on the last day` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the claim is forfeited` `action: none, asked the day after the last day` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an action made pending before the employment ended: the text names a closing edge only (fork F23): not forfeited.
#ASSERT `Art 336b(2) the claim is forfeited` `action: brought before the employment ended` EQUALS JUST FALSE
